+ |--------|-----|
+ | Post task | +5 |
+ | Claim task | +2 |
+ | Submit deliverable | +5 |
+ | Complete (worker) | +15 |
+ | Complete (owner) | +10 |
+ | Cancel task | -10 ~ -20 |
